\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Autocorrelation $C(t) = \langle Z_c(t) Z_c(0) \rangle $ for $\chi = 50, 100, 150, 200, 250, 300, 350, 400, 430$ over 30 Trotter steps. The oscillatory behaviour is a genuine quantum recurrence of the XXX model on the finite heavy-hex graph. Curves for $\chi \geq 150$ are visually indistinguishable, indicating convergence.}}{3}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
